{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_012_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c271176a5362a5e78374a7d07e6683eb7808221e5f541fff12e8c589b930c798",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3e7ac531f2e3096a742dc1ba696416b294fe695a98095d4d31be0e4c54a19f5",
      "text": "好，清单列好了！\n真不愧是监督！知道的东西真多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14777d0b48965719bdfb8d074339ef91c446e6a450cc4183dfcac241b7c983ec",
      "text": "也很了解我们。\n这个和这个，享介应该也会高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c029ce29c7b880bb6d0c185dfc8425a472b41ba10c304cf3696b58ad2ddf84c",
      "text": "啊，不过这个也很棒啊。\n我自己都想要了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77401515f4af9bd025aed18249e51d232897af7ee4d34b0c119e572ca73214c1",
      "text": "唔——不过如果以吓他一跳为目的，\n绝对是这个吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde940d011501c27301b45dc82ec18d41275ea1e655a23bd402400bb69d0c05b",
      "text": "不对，像监督说的那样，把以前送过的东西\n再送一次来吓他一跳，说不定也不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8352cf171b04b187b2a8fc96df0c3d577c2d30042474d78f69e8190dae3a9b",
      "text": "这个是消耗品，最近也没见他在用了，\n送这个的话搞不好会让他大吃一惊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6517885b3a7dac57f6e7846adf9c7f403c96ff49ef5a44868b129ef4466c655",
      "text": "怎么办啊。好纠结啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8652633d911067ceb7c6423062a70f41b02972e8981018af5fc33e42b1bdb4eb",
      "text": "要送哪一个，不如直接去实地看看商品再决定吧？\n我会陪你一起去的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5a193e1b1ff78645e5590c8b673473741b22a280e849a1a98c8494202135f21",
      "text": "真的吗？太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbc2fa6480c715f6d860ae942fb69bb1a4186b86a0c251afdcdfef7f3e898b4b",
      "text": "一起去买东西的日子，定下来吧！\n什么时候有空？快告诉我，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
